In Collaboration with Canvas Classes · Supported by MyStartupWave & Unstop
Host: X-Kernel, GRIET Hyderabad

Implements Section 6 Core Data Schemas:
- Students (with Sibling PIN support)
- Topics (with Reverse Prerequisite DAG mapping)
- Questions (with 2PL/3PL IRT parameters: difficulty_b, discrimination_a, guess_g)
- StudentProgress (with Confidence calibration: Lucky Guess vs Active Misconception)
- TeacherCohorts ('Rule of 3': Sprint, Guided, Bridge with auto-scripted blackboard lesson)
- Zero-Device Optical Scan batch processing
"""

